    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16269" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσκημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exercise, practice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.5.79
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ εἰς τὸν πόλεμον ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					11.19
				</span></i>
